{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3374ccbbd5a9e6582021d02a85f2acb3a3a3feb845078e51810e4ea17b9902e", "ja": "育、お疲れ様。短冊に願い事は……\nって、熱心に何をやってるんだ？", "zh": "育，辛苦了。说到在签笺上写愿望……\n等等，你这么认真地在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "61a6b7c232377f09c2d2e9d2ec0bbfbb790e730d0c7749cd578df5321aa3b40f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　てるてる坊主を\n作ってたの！　短冊と一緒に、かざってもいい？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！我正在做晴天娃娃！可以和许愿签一起挂起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1002_p", "source_sha256": "89f8db94c5dfeaedc98ce14288a53a8ec8de8a5f631096d95be6a675a4687b31", "ja": "もちろん、いいよ。\nでも、どうして、てるてる坊主なんだ？", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n不过，为什么是晴天娃娃呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "4aa8cf4a31d685b63908e06a9d54b8424fe3b151b05e54b90f5aa7b8aa008bfe", "ja": "だって、雨がふると織姫さまと彦星さまが会えない\nでしょ？　せっかく、約束した日なのに……。", "zh": "因为下雨的话，织女和牛郎就见不到面了，对吧？明明是好不容易约好的日子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7138559c997a2aa88f1b9fdd48938ca205e3054d5abbdc18f7d0d176460dcb18", "ja": "なるほどな。でも、きっと大丈夫！\n鳥の助けで会えるって、お話もあるんだ。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，肯定没问题！也有传说说，在鸟儿的帮助下，他们还是能见面的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "20b96c713f13cbd125ca747b4b86d9509aa3fee4aadbd80ec2a0d83715fe6415", "ja": "そうなの？　……よかった～！\nそれなら、てるてる坊主は……うーん……。", "zh": "是吗？……太好了～！\n那样的话，晴天娃娃就……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "017a8bbf6fbf65312b3f11313ee76eac081c238f2cae53fa00534ae22b258ba6", "ja": "やっぱり、てるてる坊主かざってもいい？\n織姫さまと彦星さまも、晴れてた方がうれしいもん！", "zh": "还是可以挂上晴天娃娃吗？\n织女和牛郎肯定也是晴天会更高兴嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e14bdf6f5d590687bfb3d700d7178c7ec41c3c25b90b052419b4644f56326778", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。あとで窓際に飾っておくよ。\n育のお願い、ちゃんと届くといいな。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。之后我会挂在窗边。\n希望育的愿望能顺利传达到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0312_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0312_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff0cc2523088ac8fc87147e36663729db35a1e615269c4666cd58f8d5667573f", "ja": "うん！　ありがとう、{$P$}さん！\nどうか七夕の日が晴れますように……えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n希望七夕那天是个晴天……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
